 Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":213015,"global_rank":257133,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41460},{"name":"HawkingRadiation42/MarketBasketAnalysis","owner":"HawkingRadiation42","html_url":"https://github.com/HawkingRadiation42/MarketBasketAnalysis","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213013,"global_rank":257140,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41461},{"name":"dlauritzen/SqlRest","owner":"dlauritzen","html_url":"https://github.com/dlauritzen/SqlRest","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A super-thin MySQL REST API","topics":[],"score":213009,"global_rank":257147,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41462},{"name":"malanb5/srt_parser","owner":"malanb5","html_url":"https://github.com/malanb5/srt_parser","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"quick parsing script for parsing srt subtitle files to a full transcript","topics":[],"score":213008,"global_rank":257153,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41463},{"name":"AlexFox1777/Graphs","owner":"AlexFox1777","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexFox1777/Graphs","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213008,"global_rank":257162,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41464},{"name":"Stanels42/django-API","owner":"Stanels42","html_url":"https://github.com/Stanels42/django-API","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":2,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213008,"global_rank":257165,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41465},{"name":"svia3/CS46